<title>FINLAND: Konecranes says Jan-Apr no full-yr signal.</title>
<headline>Konecranes says Jan-Apr no full-yr signal.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish industrial crane maker Konecranes on Thursday repeated its January-April earnings were not indicative for its full-year performance, which it said was expected to develop in accordance with its long-term goals.</p>
<p>&quot;As most of group earnings accumulate during the two last tertials of the year the first tertial is not indicative for the year-end result,&quot; CEO Stig Gustavson said in a statement with the company's Jan-April report.</p>
<p>&quot;1997 will be no exception to this rule. Earnings are expected to develop in accordance with group long-term goals.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +3589 6805 0247, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
